  "title": "International Clinical Trials Day: Patients Lead the Way",
  "summary": "On May 20, we recognize International Clinical Trials Day: a time to honor everyone who makes clinical research possible, especially the people living with rare diseases who choose to participate in clinical studies. For the rare disease community, clinical trials are more than a scientific milestone. They can mean extra appointments, travel, tests, and uncertainty –…",
